        "jsonBody": "={\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\"max_tokens\":1024,\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"You are a social media strategist. Given the following source content, write 5 tweets.\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Each tweet must be under 280 characters\\n- Each tweet should be standalone (makes sense without reading the others)\\n- But all 5 should be thematically linked to the source content\\n- Mix of formats: one insight, one statistic or quote, one question, one hot take, one practical tip\\n- No emojis\\n- No hashtags\\n\\nSource content:\\n{{ $json.escaped_content }}\\n\\nRespond ONLY with the 5 tweets, numbered 1-5, each on its own line. No preamble, no explanation.\"}]}",
